# This repository carries the *changes* to Thunar — the patches, the scripts
# that apply and build them, and the write-up. It deliberately does not carry
# upstream's source, upstream's dependencies, or anything built from them.
#
#   scripts/get-upstream.sh   fetches thunar/   (clone of gitlab.xfce.org + the patches)
#   scripts/fetch-vendor.sh   fetches vendor/   (Xfce 4.18 core library tarballs)
#
# Everything ignored below is reproducible from those two scripts plus
# scripts/build.sh, so nothing of value is lost by not tracking it.

# ---- upstream source ------------------------------------------------------
# A full clone of gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/thunar.git with the fork branch on top.
# ~150 MB, has its own .git, and is not ours to redistribute here.
/thunar/

# ---- third-party release tarballs -----------------------------------------
# libxfce4util / libxfce4ui / exo, needed only when targeting a host still on
# Xfce 4.16. Fetched by checksum from archive.xfce.org.
/vendor/

# ---- build and release output ---------------------------------------------
# Out-of-tree build tree: object files, config.log and generated Makefiles,
# all of which embed absolute paths and the build host's environment.
/build/
# Transfer bundles produced by scripts/make-transfer-bundle.sh.
/dist/

# ---- generic build litter -------------------------------------------------
*.o
*.lo
*.la
*.so
*.so.*
*.a
.deps/
.libs/
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.xz

# ---- editor and OS noise --------------------------------------------------
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.*.sw?
\#*\#
.#*
*.orig
*.rej
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# ---- local scratch --------------------------------------------------------
# Anything parked here stays out of the repo by default.
/scratch/
/tmp/
*.log
